      "caption": "تركيب: جِئْتُ قَبْلَ زَيْدٍ ، وَجِئْتُ بَعْدُ، و{{example|بَعْدُ}} في مربع، وبعدها = ⟨?⟩",
      "caption_en": "Tarkeeb tree of 'I came before Zaid, and I came after', with {{example|ba'du}} boxed and followed by '= ⟨?⟩'; 'before Zaid' is drawn as zarf / muta'alliq / maf'ool fih with an arrow to the verb."
